<title>UK: BZW names European emerging markets head.</title>
<headline>BZW names European emerging markets head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW said on Thursday it had appointed Marc Cheval as head of European emerging markets based in London.</p>
<p>It said he would join BZW from Goldman Sachs in May. He has been head trader for emerging markets and high yield government securities at Goldman since 1995.</p>
<p>- London newsroom +171 542 5887</p>
